ces. Looking back at the FTC=E2=80=99s pretty successful track record in ta=
ckling cross sector incidents under Section 5, it is likely that it will al=
so do well when it comes to AI. That said, it is likely that over time AI-s=
pecific refinements will be made by the FTC so that companies are more in t=
une with what it is focused on when regulating unfair or deceptive actions.=
</li>
<li>Among the variables that make up the <strong>Ethics</strong> principle =
are development policies and procedures that create, enhance, and maintain =
stakeholder trust in the application and those that demonstrate commitment =
to develop socially-beneficial AI applications. When it comes to the use of=
