<li>The model=E2=80=99s risk profile is a variable that is managed under th=
e <strong>Security</strong> principle. This task includes evaluating the co=
de and model for the degree of vulnerability to a prompt injection attack, =
misinformation, and misalignment with the <strong>Human Centered</strong> p=
rinciple. The evaluation should be conducted periodically. Its frequency wi=
