eficiency in any of these three elements works to deteriorate alignment wit=
h both core principles and this can damage an organization=E2=80=99s contra=
ctual and other obligations, such as those created by its terms of use and =
privacy policy.</li>
<li>The <strong>Permit&nbsp;</strong>core principle can apply domestically =
or internationally. Achieving the latter is relatively more complex to impl=
