<li><strong>Accountability&nbsp;</strong>is a model for identifying and ass=
igning liability. It=E2=80=99s an interdependent AI life cycle core princip=
le in that it enables other core principles such as <strong>Bias</strong>, =
<strong>Equity</strong>, <strong>Ethics</strong>, <strong>Human Centered</s=
trong>, and <strong>Reliability</strong>. However, <strong>Accountability <=
/strong>can be vulnerable to inefficiency where the amount of resources req=
