I/Microsoft), this doesn=E2=80=99t leave much hope for end user=E2=80=99s g=
etting a better deal anytime soon.</li>
<li>Effective<strong> XAI</strong> enhances compliance with the principles =
of <strong>Accountability</strong>,<strong> Reliability</strong>,<strong> F=
airness</strong>, <strong>Ethics</strong>, and <strong>Transparency</strong=
>. <strong>XAI</strong> facilitates stakeholder trust. But <strong>XAI</str=
ong> is not a principle that independently drives trust. It can deliver for=
 the user the =E2=80=9Cwhy=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=9Chow=E2=80=9D of the output=
, but not necessarily that that the output is accurate. This is where the <=
