<li>The <a href=3D"https://www.aiaaic.org/aiaaic-repository/about-the-aiaai=
c-repository">AI, Algorithmic, and Automation Incidents and Controversies (=
AIAAIC</a>) collects data about =E2=80=9Cincidents and controversies=E2=80=
=9D caused by AI. According to the AIAAIC, incidents in the =E2=80=9Cprivac=
