er not use these standards or hack them into manipulative ends. So long as =
AI-generated content is hosted on a relatively small platform, like Adobe=
=E2=80=99s Creative Cloud, it is easier to enforce compliance with CAI and =
C2PA. But how other online platforms, such as Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, =
etc., can (or are willing to) enforce the use of these and/or similar stand=
ards, remains to be seen. At the end of the day, for such metadata labeling=
