Since the RMF and 5305-F demonstrate strong alignment the <strong>Human in =
the Loop</strong> principle, the amount of resources that will need to be d=
irected to human oversight are likely to be significant. And in this settin=
g lurks a risk that I refer to as =E2=80=9Coperational fatigue.=E2=80=9D In=
 the beginning, when the AI system is new, there is a great deal of energy =
and devotion to building a <strong>Human in the Loop</strong> mindset. But =
as time goes on the amount of human oversight required to maintain it can c=
reate a drag effect. This is where the processes and procedures that suppor=
